{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_047_01_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:76d6e85695af13fcb8c6dbc4d6bde0b9bc2f0b36dcc489d0969434fb947b47ea",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_c:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_c:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1651cd1d27f13779c229a131a107b4d5056c0f360095e9fdb38e2ba7c339c026",
      "text": "又、又输了……\n明明秀先生教了我那么多的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:566407e10ead194f99e9a9e62dd826ec8e556343d66e1f6a14db08906cf8e70d",
      "text": "噗……啊哈哈！●●●●プロデューサー，\n你也太沮丧了吧。作为新手来说已经很不错了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c36cf89ea65d9bebc9af75f74f952219499ce4cd8da3dadc8b79684d8b7f92c8",
      "text": "这套卡组组合得也挺好的。\n只是跟碰到的敌人相性太差罢了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ab3ff034b24b0f22c4a5b459e295ea27afc9306d10da582ef26329137cb41c9",
      "text": "只要再把卡片强化一下，以你的水平\n很快就能赢了。毕竟你领悟得很快。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f081e834f46576bd9e8550f41701d6bc311c6a8191afd26ca72c72b9e81826c",
      "text": "真的吗？听秀先生这么一说，\n感觉自己好像能行了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20e8ef562c18eac4c7ea351a0f5577ea00b9842cb3641807a31133abcc55783a",
      "text": "话说回来，\n秀先生真的很擅长夸奖别人呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:179e429716c5c475b1b0338a880876c6869ffb09d0fcd90c386625b45b8f3f8d",
      "text": "啊，我家爷爷和奶奶\n总喜欢夸我，可能被他们传染了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_c:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c67e87558945c55c3815cc168da389bb803f048c61193993ae71a5a44a49414",
      "text": "大概因为我是独生子，所以很宠我吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aada1332d36f1616eff5a886bc1e370cffbb999264906a8dced592f695ecae9c",
      "text": "我想是因为秀先生有很多优点，\n才让人忍不住想多夸夸你吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_c:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01b194599a0965d25ce11289e2f37eca12617b75595509e7b86f9799c3a7726c",
      "text": "……我的事先别管了。快看，\n任务完成了，去领道具吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
